{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-16_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-16","title":"睁眼，便是日暮","storyCode":"JT8-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-16_end.txt","sourceHash":"41db6fed881c45b6e1ef0972c3fbfdcf9a029a50e602e16e108bb9b5740dfb86","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topburning"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"还不够。这样是不能战胜我的火的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"无智亦无勇。什么人会喜欢这种演出？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"陈晖洁，你要为别人挥剑到何时？你有哪怕一次为自己拔出过那把剑吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王，哈哈......也许诸王庭搞出了一个残劣的次品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"还不够。还不够，两位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不，已经够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"再在我脑中说话，我就要将你请出我的思绪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"已经足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官的情感......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"从赤霄那里流向了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"以前，我们两个人是没有关联的。是发生在这里的事情将我们联系在了一起，是我们感染者的命运将我们推向这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我们都认定这片大地的明天，理应比今天更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁和你不是一种人，卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛只是各个政治实体的稻草人，你会为了他们去杀害同胞，装出良善的模样，等待一个制造混乱谋取利益的时机。你们完全不在乎感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你还想绑架谁？你还想让陈长官相信你那些谎言吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你通过塔露拉绑架了整合运动，你用切尔诺伯格绑架了乌萨斯军队，让利益绑架了乌萨斯人，现在你还想绑架谁？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"识破你的谎言也很简单，因为你只说结果与动机，却从不说会发生什么！你对塔露拉的许诺也是相同的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你答应陈长官和整合运动说要让感染者有一片可以居住的地方，答应一场大战之后感染者终将崛起，可是，如果是塔露拉，她是不会再许诺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因为当时的那个承诺已经伤她够深了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......我有些后悔。要是早点认识你，也许很多事情都会不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但很多错我已经犯下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，那时候的陈长官，也不一定会认同我现在的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不是长官了。叫我陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也行，这样正式点。会不会太正式了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，让你看见我们姐妹那么难看的那一面。我以为我们的重逢会更戏剧性些......或者更俗套些的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得再怎么俗套，当久别重逢以后，我们的感情就是一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"流泪很俗套吗？我不觉得。普通人都会流泪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"口才不错，卡特斯。情感攻势也拿捏得很准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，雄辩当用来说服王庭与元老院，征服议会与摇摆不定的软蛋，煽动盲目的军士与暴躁的领民......而不是用来说服我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"“卡兹戴尔三次毁于大火。它数次得重建，得千万新血，得王庭盘踞，只是先前住民皆已身化灰烬，随风而去。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"在切城时，你曾举起一面屏障，拦下我的呼吸......我放走了你，因为为你牺牲的英勇战士当得尊崇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，你已得我注视。你不再有机会逃走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"活过一场火焚吧，卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了......！阿米娅！快来我这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我在与她对话，而不是你，妹妹。现在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——闻闻烧焦的她会是什么味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_23"},{"type":"narration","text":"烈焰自无形化作有形，白色的火浪呼啸着自四面八方扑向阿米娅，将她与她所踩的地面彻底包裹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你试试看，你如果现在出剑，会不会把我的法术和她一起切开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"放开她！塔露拉，放开她！你想杀的人是我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"太迟了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三分钟已经到了。时间已经够了。\n她们的思绪跨过了龙门与切尔诺伯格，她们的记忆越过了北部荒原与乌萨斯的土地。\n自己已经厘清了陈的想法。自己已经把陈的战斗全都浓聚在此。自己已经把龙门与切尔诺伯格，以及北原上的一切烙在身上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的线条自焰球内喷涌而出，继而收束成形，在焰球上划开裂口。\n白焰忽尔消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"是什么切开了焰狱......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅剧烈地喘息着。\n她闭上眼。\n许多想法在阿米娅的脑海中成型，又迅速散去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"她记得霜星咬牙切齿的悲鸣。\n她看见温迪戈屹立不倒的遗躯。\n她听过阿丽娜压抑不住的轻呼。\n她看见Ace与Scout，想起精英干员们在酒会上跳舞。\n她也想起丽萨从烤箱里端出姜饼，想起米米的手工小胸牌，看见稚日在走道停电时胸口亮起的微弱的光和他傻笑着的雀斑脸。\n她想起爸爸和妈妈。\n她看见妈妈帮她稳住琴弓时托住她肩膀的手，妈妈的手指白皙又修长，但伤疤和老茧蹭得她有些难受。\n她看见爸爸把她推出门外后摔落下去，她想不起爸爸说了什么，只记得他眼带泪花，说了声再见，活下去，阿米娅。\n她看见特蕾西娅将剑刺入自己胸膛。\n她看见特蕾西娅说了声晚安后关上了灯。\n她看见特蕾西娅为她挑了件白色的衣裳，笑得比自己还开心。\n她看见博士走在她身前。她看见博士回头，等她走到身旁，才继续迈步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅的泪滴在火焰中蒸发。\n只因为我们是感染者吗？阿米娅问到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你恨他们吗？阿米娅轻声问。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色与青色浸透了长剑的每个部分，那重量压在阿米娅的肩上，那长剑握在阿米娅手里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅知道，在杀死所有背誓者后，这个高大的萨卡兹自尽了。\n阿米娅也知道，这把剑随后化作飞灰，仿佛不曾存在过。\n但这个萨卡兹君王的青色愤怒，早已和他的经历一起，成为了阿米娅的一部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"“拔刀之招，当破即破。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_victoria"},{"type":"narration","text":"“泪锋之招，当断即断。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"narration","text":"“泪锋之剑，当弃即弃。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cenbri"},{"type":"narration","text":"“云裂之剑，当立则立。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topburning"},{"type":"narration","text":"更多的记忆坠入阿米娅的思绪，时代的洪流在阿米娅的思维中涌动。\n那不是个好结局。但阿米娅已经没有时间了。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅看见陈的怒视。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅看见塔露拉的火焰。\n阿米娅清楚，她们必须在这里解决这件事。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_chen"},{"type":"narration","text":"这把愤怒的剑不会只是过去的剑。它还必须是现在的剑。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅握紧了剑柄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topburning"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......剑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"从纺织转化成切割。蕴含的能量没有增加，形式却改变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"真货。卡特斯，恭喜你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是什么碎片，不是实验品，不是模仿者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你的确是萨卡兹的君主......人类之敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"不，站在你面前的是一个感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"一个......人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我有点......说不出话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你这是......什么魔术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"这个，现在应该不怎么重要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"确实。但其实挺重要的，事关尊严问题。为什么你拿着和赤霄几乎差不多像的剑？为什么你会我苦练了十几年的剑术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"（陈小姐......有这么严重吗？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"闲话，下次再说。这把剑，有多像赤霄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以当它就是另一把赤霄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好，阿米娅。你记得我多少剑术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"全都记得。我看在眼里，我从你的心里发现的，我全都记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你从我心里发现了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，陈小姐......不，不用担心，我只看了那些你希望我能学会的东西。我能判别这些事情，唔，也真的没看别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"全忘掉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾总说，想使唤赤霄，归根结底不靠剑术，靠的是心境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我总当他乱讲嘢，但也还是得承认，他的剑术造诣，我这辈子都别想赶上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，他在谈合作讲道理的时候你可以当他是放屁，但要用剑，就听我一回，听他一回！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"两把剑。你居然选择了赤霄这样恶毒的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"武器，哪有什么恶毒不恶毒？这大地上的武器，有哪一把能比你恶毒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，听好......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你的愤慨和我的怒火如出一辙，我们的剑就不分彼此！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"上了，阿米娅！先不要管她死活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！真的可以吗......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"别想得我们好像真有得选一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的武器给了你们信心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"滑稽戏我今天已经看过一场，不想再看第二遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"试试你的剑吧，卡特斯。看看你的技术怎么样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"太慢了！赤霄！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"拔刀！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_37"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"（凯尔希医生说的是真的，赤霄的确是能切开法术的剑......！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不断吞噬周遭事物的无形火焰，在青黑色与红色闪烁过后消散如无物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"伤口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"从我真正自恨意里重生到现在，这副身体尚不曾受到过一点伤害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然只划到她的手指......她法术里蕴含的能量，实在是太大了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"别小看这一点点伤口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"每次你都给她留一个伤口，千百个伤口之后，她也就失血而死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这样说真让我伤心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"披着那张皮说这种话，你以为你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门近卫局真是培养了个好心肠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"和外人一起伤害亲人的身体，你很开心的样子，晖洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你也敢这么叫我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是想杀我的话，就下手吧，晖洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经永远都回不去了。我恨这一切。我恨你。我恨养育你的这片土地。它把你变成这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了我吧，让我解脱吧。否则，我就会杀了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"至少......至少......晖洁，晖洁......别让我动手杀你。我不想，我不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕我是因为你才变成这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......二十年前那一次，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"是你不和我一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"是你逃了，是你退缩了，晖洁。我变成这个样子......变成这个我也厌恶的样子......都是因为你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"都是因为你。都是因为你答应过了却反悔了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"那个月夜，那个下着倾盆大雨的夜晚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么心甘情愿地留在那条恶龙身边？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"他杀了我爸，逼死我们的妈妈......害我们两人分离！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，你还要帮他做事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"它说谎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐，你仔细想想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上究竟是什么样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那是个晴天。我绝对不会记错......那天晚上，虽然没有月亮，没有星星——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但你拉我出去的时候，是白天。那天是白天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"不。塔露拉，科西切的源石技艺不是在他死后才生效的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"他从那时候开始，就已经对你施用了这个法术了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"想一想吧。你有多少思绪被扭曲了，你有多少记忆被蒙上了薄纱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"就算他没篡改你的记忆，可是你记忆里那些不分明的东西，还是被他利用了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，如果你还是塔露拉的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕你想要发动一场战争，哪怕你会牺牲很多人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"你会为了自己，让他们毫无价值地死去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的要牺牲，你难道不才是那第一个吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"你会允许雪怪和霜星无助地死去吗？你会用爱国者保护着的东西去摧毁你尊敬的他吗？你会允许无数的乌萨斯人，无数的感染者，因此死去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。你是撼动不了我的意志的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你们就连动作都一模一样，连节奏都吻合......我有点犯恶心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这两把剑还奈何不了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的体力会随着时间耗尽，我的火焰却是无穷无尽的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"剑是你们手足的伸展，而我就是力量本身。你们将被疲劳击垮，而我会取走你们的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，睁开眼睛看看吧......这样的结果，这样的惨剧，就是你想要的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你想要的吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"够了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"藏在蛋壳里是没用的。面对我。"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅仰起头。\n她这样说，仿佛陈述事实。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈看了看阿米娅。身边的女孩已经和十分钟前的阿米娅判若两人。\n她反常的语气令人惊讶，那种感觉，像是有三分之一来自阿米娅本人，三分之一惟妙惟肖地学着自己，还有三分之一......\n陈也不知道那是什么东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德拉克双唇紧闭。\n在多次吞吐词句后，她还是开口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你又从谁那里看到了些什么景象？听到了什么遗言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，将死之人才喜欢复述业已腐朽的辞句。过去的一切都伤不了我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"与此同时，她敲打着剑柄，轻轻拨开眼前晃动的空气，将高温泼洒向同是感染者的两人。\n陈大吼。就在她要出剑之前，她忽然觉得，也许这一剑让阿米娅来更好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"赤霄，奔夜！"},{"type":"narration","text":"她侧过头看着陈，笑了一笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不好意思，是这样的剑术，没错吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蓝色？黑色......大概是青色。很好看。相比之下赤霄实在是太血腥了。\n陈这时心想，这场战斗也许就该这样。\n供氧装置已经在战斗中被焚毁，背着氧气盒子和一条火龙干架纯属是想炸死自己。\n陈没好气地丢掉了多余的装备，深感自己的准备规划还是做得过于草率。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，可没剩多少时间了，她打算把这里的氧气烧干。"},{"type":"narration","text":"身旁的兔子同样也身经百战，这句提醒肯定是不必要的，但足够转移自己的注意力了。\n这么做的原因只有一个。陈要转移自己的注意力。陈深深地吸了一口气。\n现在的自己一点也不冷静。\n不甘被剑鞘束缚，锋芒暂敛的赤霄剑在匣中剧烈颤动，也像是为了之后那场猛烈的释放而压抑到癫狂。\n不过，很可能只是因为自己的手在颤抖。\n这么多年来，只有这次......只有这次，陈确实感受到了赤霄剑的强韧，她生怕自己握不住剑，却也不由得和这把剑一同狂喜。\n陈好像突然明白了。赤霄没有意志，赤霄的意志来自用剑的人。\n之前的她不是拔不出赤霄。她是没碰到那个必须要用这把剑的时候。\n而现在，面前的熊熊烈火，面前的恶棍，面前久违的友人，亲人与罪人，以及彻底的绝境，重重地压在了她身上。\n颤抖渐止，陈感觉已经是时候了。赤霄等得太久了。\n自己也等得太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐，请等等。我们也许能伤害到她，我们可能有这种能力。就算我们能杀她也没用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅也觉得这不像是自己在说话。\n她像一把利刃，像一把被不公和惨事压弯了剑身的利刃，尽管如此，阿米娅却觉得，这利刃会弹回原状，锋利如初。\n她感觉自己有点像陈。\n也不坏。她终究不可能是陈。\n阿米娅望着塔露拉。\n陈小姐，以前你抓捕犯人，是为了鞭打他和侮辱他吗？是为了夺走他的生命吗？\n她的无名怒火却不像陈。她感到被背叛，感到被驱使，感到被孤立，她在历经一个尚未结束的故事，一个灰暗却依然还在的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"那应该只是个结果，我想。何况我们并没那个权力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你会说，就这样洗脱她的嫌疑也太容易了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"不，陈长官......陈小姐。不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"但她的嫌疑是否能洗脱，还要等到事解决之后。"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈咬住嘴唇，直到出血。血亲相残，她怎么会为这种事感到喜悦？她说不清。\n她忍住没将赤霄举起。\n她叹了一口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。那只是结果。我首先要让他们罪有应得。死要留到判刑以后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的信心是从哪里来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这不叫信心，怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这叫责任。"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈昂首挺胸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有义务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"科西切，你却什么都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"你的身躯是借来的，你的谎言会被戳穿，你的火焰在赤霄前摇摇欲坠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"你把这里选作战场，盘踞在你的武器和伪装之上，你没有离开核心城，既是傲慢，也是愚鲁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"你作茧自缚，已经无处可逃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉？"]}]}
